     "body": "<p>This issue has been resolved by;</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Adding the server.properties file to fedora-client.jar and fedora-messaging.jar so that property values can be resolved correctly</li>\n\t<li>Adding an option in the messaging client to start the connection to the messaging provider asynchronously, and updating GSearch to use this option. When starting the UpdateListener in GSearch, if a connection cannot be made a wait and retry will occur in a separate thread. This will allow Fedora to start up and make the messaging provider available.</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "10/Oct/08 3:13 PM",
