  "description": "<p>Allow GSearch to start and stop properly when running in the same Tomcat server as Fedora. This involves making Server.properties available as there is currently an unmet runtime dependency there, as well as setting up a mechanism to handle GSearch starting prior to Fedora but still being able to connect to the message broker which is started by Fedora in the default configuration.</p>",
